description:
Implement `useDialog` — a hook that controls a native `<dialog>` element using its `showModal()` and `close()` methods, tracking open state.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { ref, open, close, isOpen } = useDialog();
return (
  <>
    <button onClick={open}>Open</button>
    <dialog ref={ref}>
      <button onClick={close}>Close</button>
    </dialog>
  </>
);
```

